From 1947b6b6c30d214baf3db2072f95ed51ccb2dae3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 12:18:48 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(geometry): add deterministic true-shape nesting
 kernel

Add exact NFP/IFP placement, cut clearance, hole nesting, multi-sheet reports,
and named input refusals while preserving the existing raster API.
Pin placement and clearance behavior with regression tests and mutation checks.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2158
